        <mxCell id="note" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#B8C7E6;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#20304A;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;Simple idea:&lt;/b&gt; The application server handles shortening and redirection. Redis speeds up frequent redirects, while the database remains the main URL store. Analytics is optional and asynchronous." vertex="1">
